  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0036, merged in PR #4181): node.id grammar is fixed as anchored 5-slot with colon-free lang/span/name/kind and a colon-tolerant path, parseable from both ends; names are sanitized ':' -> '.' (lossy — fidelity lives in Symbol.name) and sentinels are enumerated. The 12 escaping nodes (rust :: namespacing, npm packages, route IDs) become conformance bugs against this grammar. Stays violated until the emitter fixes land; re-validate then."  # 6d47
